# Files excluded from the shinyapps.io deployment bundle (rsconnect >= 1.0).
# deploy.R bundles an explicit file list (app.R, aqs.env, cache/*.rds); this
# file only matters for a plain rsconnect::deployApp().
# NOTE: shinyapps.io does NOT support server-side envVars, so the AQS
# credentials ship as aqs.env, which deploy.R writes from ~/.Renviron and
# deletes afterwards (visible only to this shinyapps.io account). A project
# .Renviron is never bundled. If you ever migrate to Posit Connect, use
#   rsconnect::deployApp(envVars = c("AQS_EMAIL", "AQS_KEY"))
.Renviron
.Rhistory
.git
deploy.R
manifest.json
.gitignore
data
docs
output
scratch
scripts
rsconnect
MS_Raw_Monitor_Cache.rds
LICENSE
README.md
